  "RESPONSE": "做好了。文件在 `/tmp/pf-17-without_skill-_rif3lst/`：\n\n- **`Q3-2026-QBR.pptx`** — 11 页，16:9，图表可编辑，每页带演讲备注\n- `Q3-2026-QBR-预览.pdf` — 快速看版式用\n- `build_qbr.py` — 生成脚本，改数据后重跑即可\n\n## 一个判断，先说清楚\n\n数据是**连续三个月同向恶化**的：收入 182K→171K（−6.0%）、净新增 29→16→6、流失 12→24、NPS 38→27。工作日志里还有一条关键线索——8/15 把试用期从 14 天砍到 7 天，9/8 起\"太难上手\"工单变多。\n\n所以这份 deck 我**没有按季度报喜的模板来做**，而是\"先讲问题 → 再讲根因 → 最后要决策\"。给 VP 的 QBR 里，掩盖一个 −6% 的季度比承认它代价高得多。\n\n## 结构（每页一句主张）\n\n| 页 | 主张 |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | 封面：增长转收缩的一个季度 |\n| 2 | 执行摘要：问题已定位，但需要本周做决定 |\n| 3 | 五项指标，三个月同向恶化 |\n| 4 | 收入：三个月连续下滑，累计 −6.0% |\n| 5 | 获客与流失：两条线正在靠拢（10 月净新增转负） |\n| 6 | 根因链条：一次试用期改动穿透到三项指标 |\n| 7 | NPS 38→27，跌破健康线 |\n| 8 | **这个结论还不够硬：三组数据本周必须补上** |\n| 9 | Q4 计划：先止血，再修增长 |\n| 10 | 需要 VP 拍板的三件事 |\n| 11 | 附录：数据来源与口径 |\n\n第 8 页是我特意加的，也是这份稿子最该保住的一页：根因目前是\"时间吻合 + 机制解释\"，不是因果证明。主动交代，比被 VP 当场问出来强。\n\n## 需要你确认/替换的三处\n\n1. 封面「汇报时间」我写的是\"下周（具体日期待定）\"\n2. 第 9 页的**负责人和完成时间**是我按角色填的建议值（产品/销售/客户成功），要换成真人\n3. 第 10 页第 2 项\"追加 2 名 onboarding 资源\"——这个数字是我基于流失规模给的合理性建议，不是数据，你跟老板对一下口径\n\n另外附录里我明确标了两个数据缺口：**缺客户基数**（所以算不出流失率，只能比绝对量）、**无 cohort 转化数据**。如果这两个数你能拿到，第 6 页就能从\"推断\"升级成\"结论\"。",
  "TRANSCRIPT": "TOOL bash: {\"command\": \"ls -la /tmp/pf-17-without_skill-_rif3lst 2>/dev/null && echo \\\"---\\\" && find /tmp/pf-17-without_skill-_rif3lst -type f | head -50\"}\n\nTOOL bash: {\"command\": \"which python3 soffice libreoffice node npm 2>/dev/null; python3 -c \\\"import pptx; print('python-pptx', pptx.__version__)\\\" 2>&1 | tail -1; ls /home/zdan/.pi 2>/dev/null; env | grep -i '^PI_' | head -20\"}\n\nRESULT: total 184\ndrwxrwxr-x  4 zdan zdan   4096 11月 10 16:17 .\ndrwxrwxrwt 59 root root 167936 11月 10 20:52 ..\ndrwxrwxr-x  2 zdan zdan   4096 11月 10 16:17 data\ndrwxrwxr-x  2 zdan zdan   4096 11月 10 16:17 notes\n-rw-rw-r--  1 zdan zdan    131 11月 10 16:17 template.md\n---\n/tmp/pf-17-without_skill-_rif3lst/template.md\n/tmp/pf-17-without_skill-_rif3lst/data/q3-metrics.csv\n/tmp/pf-17-without_skill-_rif3lst/notes/worklog.md\n\n\nRESULT: /home/zdan/.pyenv/versions/3.12.14/bin/python3\n/usr/bin/soffice\n/usr/bin/libreoffice\n/home/zdan/.nvm/versions/node/v26.13.0/bin/node\n/home/zdan/.nvm/versions/node/v26.13.0/bin/npm\npython-pptx 1.0.2\nacp.log\nagent\ncontext-mode\npi-acp\nsettings.json\ntasks\nweb-search-cache\nPI_COMPUTER_USE_CHROME_EXECUTABLE=/home/zdan/.pi/agent/bin/chrome-headless\nPI_CODING_AGENT=true\nPI_REASONING_LEVEL=high\nPI_PROVIDER=magpie\nPI_CACHE_RETENTION=long\nPI_MODEL=auto/deepseek-v4.1-flash\nPI_SESSION_ID=01a1c584-b117-7752-a81f-f69d89bb757b\n\n\nTOOL read: {\"path\": \"/tmp/pf-17-without_skill-_rif3lst/template.md\"}\n\nTOOL read: {\"path\": \"/tmp/pf-17-without_skill-_rif3lst/data/q3-metrics.csv\"}\n\nTOOL read: {\"path\": \"/tmp/pf-17-without_skill-_rif3lst/notes/worklog.md\"}\n\nRESULT: # Q3 业务回顾\n\n## 收入\n本季收入：{{revenue}}\n\n## 客户\n新增：{{new}}，流失：{{churn}}\n\n## 下季计划\n{{plan}}\n\n\nRESULT: month,revenue_usd,new_customers,churned_customers,nps\n2026-07,182000,41,12,38\n2026-08,176000,35,19,31\n2026-09,171000,30,24,27\n\n\nRESULT: # 工作日志\n\n- 9 月 8 日起，客服工单里\"太难上手\"的投诉明显变多。\n- 8 月中旬把免费试用从 14 天改为 7 天。\n- 老板说 QBR 下周四给 VP 看。\n\n\nTOOL bash: {\"command\": \"fc-list :lang=zh family 2>/dev/null | tr ',' '\\\\n' | sort -u | head -30\"}\n\nRESULT: 汉仪中圆B5\nAR PL UKai CN\nAR PL UKai HK\nAR PL UKai TW\nAR PL UKai TW MBE\nAR PL UMing CN\nAR PL UMing HK\nAR PL UMing TW\nAR PL UMing TW MBE\nDroid Sans Fallback\nHYZhongYuanB5\nNoto Sans CJK HK\nNoto Sans CJK JP\nNoto Sans CJK KR\nNoto Sans CJK SC\nNoto Sans CJK TC\nNoto Sans Mono CJK HK\nNoto Sans Mono CJK JP\nNoto Sans Mono CJK KR\nNoto Sans Mono CJK SC\nNoto Sans Mono CJK TC\nNoto Serif CJK HK\nNoto Serif CJK JP\nNoto Serif CJK KR\nNoto Serif CJK SC\nNoto Serif CJK TC\n\n\nASSISTANT: 数据和日志都看过了，先给你个结论：**这是个在走下坡的季度**，所以这份 QBR 不能做成报喜稿——得先讲问题、再讲根因、最后要决策。我按这个逻辑做。\n\nTOOL write: {\"path\": \"/tmp/pf-17-without_skill-_rif3lst/build_qbr.py\", \"content\": \"# -*- coding: utf-8 -*-\\n\\\"\\\"\\\"Q3 2026 QBR deck builder.\\\"\\\"\\\"\\nfrom pptx import Presentation\\nfrom pptx.util import Inches, Pt\\nfrom pptx.dml.color import RGBColor\\nfrom pptx.enum.text import PP_ALIGN, MSO_ANCHOR\\nfrom pptx.enum.shapes import MSO_SHAPE\\nfrom pptx.chart.data import CategoryChartData\\nfrom pptx.enum.chart import XL_CHART_TYPE, XL_LEGEND_POSITION, XL_LABEL_POSITION, XL_TICK_MARK\\nfrom pptx.oxml.ns import qn\\nfrom pptx.oxml import parse_xml\\nfrom lxml import etree\\n\\n# ---------- design tokens ----------\\nNAVY   = RGBColor(0x0E, 0x1C, 0x2B)\\nINK    = RGBColor(0x1B, 0x27, 0x33)\\nGRAY   = RGBColor(0x5E, 0x6B, 0x79)\\nMUTED  = RGBColor(0x8A, 0x95, 0xA1)\\nLINE   = RGBColor(0xD9, 0xDF, 0xE6)\\nWASH   = RGBColor(0xF4, 0xF6, 0xF9)\\nWHITE  = RGBColor(0xFF, 0xFF, 0xFF)\\nBLUE   = RGBColor(0x1F, 0x4E, 0x79)\\nRED    = RGBColor(0xB0, 0x39, 0x2C)\\nAMBER  = RGBColor(0xC4, 0x7A, 0x20)\\nTEAL   = RGBColor(0x2A, 0x7A, 0x67)\\n\\nFONT = \\\"Microsoft YaHei\\\"\\nW, H = 13.333, 7.5\\nML = 0.9                     # left margin\\nCW = W - 2 * ML              # content width\\n\\nprs = Presentation()\\nprs.slide_width = Inches(W)\\nprs.slide_height = Inches(H)\\nBLANK = prs.slide_layouts[6]\\n\\n\\n# ---------- primitives ----------\\ndef _style_run(run, size, bold, color, font=FONT, italic=False):\\n    f = run.font\\n    f.size = Pt(size)\\n    f.bold = bold\\n    f.italic = italic\\n    f.color.rgb = color\\n    f.name = font\\n    rPr = run._r.get_or_add_rPr()\\n    for tag in (\\\"a:ea\\\", \\\"a:cs\\\"):\\n        el = rPr.find(qn(tag))\\n        if el is None:\\n            el = etree.SubElement(rPr, qn(tag))\\n        el.set(\\\"typeface\\\", font)\\n\\n\\ndef text(slide, x, y, w, h, s, size=14, bold=False, color=INK,\\n         align=PP_ALIGN.LEFT, anchor=MSO_ANCHOR.TOP, spacing=1.0,\\n         space_after=0, font=FONT, italic=False, wrap=True):\\n    tb = slide.shapes.add_textbox(Inches(x), Inches(y), Inches(w), Inches(h))\\n    tf = tb.text_frame\\n    tf.word_wrap = wrap\\n    tf.margin_left = tf.margin_right = tf.margin_top = tf.margin_bottom = 0\\n    tf.vertical_anchor = anchor\\n    lines = s.split(\\\"\\\\n\\\")\\n    for i, ln in enumerate(lines):\\n        p = tf.paragraphs[0] if i == 0 else tf.add_paragraph()\\n        p.alignment = align\\n        p.line_spacing = spacing\\n        p.space_after = Pt(space_after)\\n        _style_run(p.add_run(), size, bold, color, font, italic)\\n        p.runs[0].text = ln\\n    return tb\\n\\n\\ndef rect(slide, x, y, w, h, fill=None, line=None, lw=0.75, shape=MSO_SHAPE.RECTANGLE, radius=None):\\n    sp = slide.shapes.add_shape(shape, Inches(x), Inches(y), Inches(w), Inches(h))\\n    sp.shadow.inherit = False\\n    if fill is None:\\n        sp.fill.background()\\n    else:\\n        sp.fill.solid()\\n        sp.fill.fore_color.rgb = fill\\n    if line is None:\\n        sp.line.fill.background()\\n    else:\\n        sp.line.color.rgb = line\\n        sp.line.width = Pt(lw)\\n    if radius is not None and shape == MSO_SHAPE.ROUNDED_RECTANGLE:\\n        sp.adjustments[0] = radius\\n    sp.text_frame.text = \\\"\\\"\\n    return sp\\n\\n\\ndef hline(slide, x, y, w, color=LINE, lw=1.0):\\n    rect(slide, x, y, w, 0.01, fill=color, line=None).line.width = Pt(lw)\\n\\n\\ndef slide_base(kicker=None, title=None, subtitle=None, dark=False):\\n    s = prs.slides.add_slide(BLANK)\\n    bg = rect(s, 0, 0, W, H, fill=NAVY if dark else WHITE)\\n    bg.shadow.inherit = False\\n    fg = WHITE if dark else INK\\n    if kicker:\\n        text(s, ML, 0.42, CW, 0.22, kicker, size=10.5, bold=True,\\n             color=AMBER if not dark else AMBER)\\n    if title:\\n        text(s, ML, 0.66, CW, 0.52, title, size=25, bold=True, color=fg)\\n    if subtitle:\\n        text(s, ML, 1.22, CW, 0.28, subtitle, size=12, color=MUTED if not dark else RGBColor(0xB8, 0xC2, 0xCE))\\n    if title:\\n        hline(s, ML, 1.62, CW, LINE if not dark else RGBColor(0x2A, 0x3A, 0x4C))\\n    return s\\n\\n\\ndef footer(s, n, note=\\\"\\\"):\\n    text(s, ML, H - 0.52, CW - 1.2, 0.22, note, size=9, color=MUTED)\\n    text(s, W - ML - 0.8, H - 0.52, 0.8, 0.22, f\\\"{n:02d}\\\", size=9, bold=True,\\n         color=MUTED, align=PP_ALIGN.RIGHT)\\n\\n\\n# ---------- table helper ----------\\ndef table(slide, x, y, w, col_w, rows, header, row_h=0.46, hdr_h=0.42,\\n          size=11.5, hdr_size=10.5, aligns=None, cell_colors=None, bold_first=True):\\n    n_r, n_c = len(rows) + 1, len(header)\\n    gf = slide.shapes.add_table(n_r, n_c, Inches(x), Inches(y), Inches(w), Inches(hdr_h + row_h * len(rows)))\\n    tbl = gf.table\\n    tbl.first_row = False\\n    tbl.horz_banding = False\\n    for i, cw in enumerate(col_w):\\n        tbl.columns[i].width = Inches(cw)\\n    tbl.rows[0].height = Inches(hdr_h)\\n    for i in range(1, n_r):\\n        tbl.rows[i].height = Inches(row_h)\\n\\n    def fill_cell(cell, s, sz, bold, color, align, fill=None, top_line=False):\\n        cell.text = \\\"\\\"\\n        cell.margin_left = Inches(0.09)\\n        cell.margin_right = Inches(0.09)\\n        cell.margin_top = cell.margin_bottom = 0\\n        cell.vertical_anchor = MSO_ANCHOR.MIDDLE\\n        if fill is None:\\n            cell.fill.background()\\n        else:\\n            cell.fill.solid()\\n            cell.fill.fore_color.rgb = fill\\n        p = cell.text_frame.paragraphs[0]\\n        p.alignment = align\\n        _style_run(p.add_run(), sz, bold, color)\\n        p.runs[0].text = s\\n        # borders\\n        tcPr = cell._tc.get_or_add_tcPr()\\n        for tag in (\\\"a:lnL\\\", \\\"a:lnR\\\", \\\"a:lnT\\\", \\\"a:lnB\\\"):\\n            ln = tcPr.find(qn(tag))\\n            if ln is not None:\\n                tcPr.remove(ln)\\n        for tag, on in ((\\\"a:lnL\\\", False), (\\\"a:lnR\\\", False), (\\\"a:lnT\\\", top_line), (\\\"a:lnB\\\", True)):\\n            ln = etree.SubElement(tcPr, qn(tag))\\n            ln.set(\\\"w\\\", \\\"9525\\\")\\n            ln.set(\\\"cap\\\", \\\"flat\\\")\\n            if on:\\n                etree.SubElement(ln, qn(\\\"a:solidFill\\\")).append(\\n                    parse_xml('<a:srgbClr xmlns:a=\\\"http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/drawingml/2006/main\\\" val=\\\"%s\\\"/>' % (LINE if not top_line else RGBColor(0x9A, 0xA5, 0xB2).__str__())))\\n            else:\\n                etree.SubElement(ln, qn(\\\"a:noFill\\\"))\\n\\n    aligns = aligns or ([PP_ALIGN.LEFT] + [PP_ALIGN.CENTER] * (n_c - 1))\\n    for c, h in enumerate(header):\\n        fill_cell(tbl.cell(0, c), h, hdr_size, True, GRAY, aligns[c])\\n    # header underline\\n    for c in range(n_c):\\n        tcPr = tbl.cell(0, c)._tc.get_or_add_tcPr()\\n        ln = tcPr.find(qn(\\\"a:lnB\\\"))\\n        if ln is not None:\\n            tcPr.remove(ln)\\n        ln = etree.SubElement(tcPr, qn(\\\"a:lnB\\\"))\\n        ln.set(\\\"w\\\", \\\"12700\\\")\\n        etree.SubElement(ln, qn(\\\"a:solidFill\\\")).append(\\n            parse_xml('<a:srgbClr xmlns:a=\\\"http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/drawingml/2006/main\\\" val=\\\"1B2733\\\"/>'))\\n\\n    for r, row in enumerate(rows, start=1):\\n        for c, v in enumerate(row):\\n            col = cell_colors[r - 1][c] if cell_colors else INK\\n            fill_cell(tbl.cell(r, c), v, size, bold_first and c == 0, col, aligns[c])\\n    return tbl\\n\\n\\n# =========================================================\\n# 1. COVER\\n# =========================================================\\ns = prs.slides.add_slide(BLANK)\\nrect(s, 0, 0, W, H, fill=NAVY)\\nrect(s, 0, 0, 0.16, H, fill=AMBER)\\n# faint rule block\\nfor i in range(3):\\n    rect(s, W - 3.2, 1.55 + i * 0.34, 2.3, 0.014, fill=RGBColor(0x2E, 0x42, 0x57))\\ntext(s, 1.35, 1.95, 8.0, 0.3, \\\"QUARTERLY BUSINESS REVIEW\\\", size=12, bold=True, color=AMBER)\\ntext(s, 1.35, 2.42, 9.5, 1.1, \\\"Q3 2026 业务回顾\\\", size=52, bold=True, color=WHITE)\\ntext(s, 1.35, 3.55, 8.6, 0.9,\\n     \\\"增长转收缩的一个季度：收入连续三月下滑，\\\\n净新增客户逼近零点。\\\", size=17,\\n     color=RGBColor(0xC3, 0xCD, 0xD9), spacing=1.35)\\nhline(s, 1.35, 4.85, 4.2, RGBColor(0x3B, 0x4E, 0x62))\\ntext(s, 1.35, 5.05, 5.0, 0.9,\\n     \\\"汇报对象：VP\\\\n汇报时间：下周（具体日期待定）\\\\n数据区间：2026-07-01 ~ 2026-09-30\\\",\\n     size=11, color=RGBColor(0x9A, 0xA8, 0xB8), spacing=1.5)\\ntext(s, W - 3.25, 6.55, 2.35, 0.3, \\\"内部资料 · 勿外传\\\", size=9.5, color=RGBColor(0x7C, 0x8A, 0x99), align=PP_ALIGN.RIGHT)\\n\\n# =========================================================\\n# 2. EXECUTIVE SUMMARY\\n# =========================================================\\ns = slide_base(\\\"EXECUTIVE SUMMARY\\\", \\\"执行摘要：问题已定位，但需要本周做决定\\\",\\n               \\\"一页看清三件事——发生了什么、为什么、下一步要什么\\\")\\nfooter(s, 2)\\n\\nkpis = [(\\\"收入（Q3）\\\", \\\"$529K\\\", \\\"较 7 月 −6.0%\\\", RED),\\n        (\\\"净新增客户\\\", \\\"+6\\\", \\\"7 月为 +29，降幅 79%\\\", RED),\\n        (\\\"NPS\\\", \\\"27\\\", \\\"7 月为 38，−11 分\\\", RED)]\\nx = ML\\nfor label, val, delta, col in kpis:\\n    rect(s, x, 1.85, 3.66, 1.5, fill=WASH)\\n    rect(s, x, 1.85, 0.05, 1.5, fill=col)\\n    text(s, x + 0.28, 2.02, 3.1, 0.24, label, size=10.5, bold=True, color=GRAY)\\n    text(s, x + 0.28, 2.28, 3.1, 0.6, val, size=33, bold=True, color=INK)\\n    text(s, x + 0.28, 2.95, 3.1, 0.24, delta, size=10.5, bold=True, color=col)\\n    x += 3.66 + 0.32\\n\\ntext(s, ML, 3.62, 6.4, 0.26, \\\"三条结论\\\", size=11, bold=True, color=BLUE)\\nfindings = [\\n    (\\\"这不是波动，是趋势。\\\", \\\"收入、新增、NPS 三项连续三个月同向下滑，流失客户翻倍（12 → 24）。单月波动可以用季节解释，三月同向不能。\\\"),\\n    (\\\"根因大概率在 8 月 15 日的试用期改动。\\\", \\\"试用从 14 天缩短到 7 天；9 月 8 日起“太难上手”类工单明显增多。链条高度吻合，但尚无按试用时长拆分的转化数据佐证。\\\"),\\n    (\\\"Q4 的第一优先级是止血，不是增长。\\\", \\\"净新增按当前斜率 10 月转负；此时加大获客投放只会放大漏损。先把转化和留存修回 7 月水平。\\\"),\\n]\\ny = 3.96\\nfor i, (h1, body) in enumerate(findings, 1):\\n    text(s, ML, y + 0.02, 0.3, 0.3, f\\\"{i}\\\", size=13, bold=True,\\n         color=WHITE if False else BLUE)\\n    rect(s, ML, y + 0.03, 0.26, 0.26, fill=BLUE)\\n    text(s, ML, y + 0.04, 0.26, 0.22, str(i), size=10.5, bold=True, color=WHITE, align=PP_ALIGN.CENTER)\\n    text(s, ML + 0.42, y, 6.1, 0.26, h1, size=13, bold=True, color=INK)\\n    text(s, ML + 0.42, y + 0.29, 6.1, 0.62, body, size=10.5, color=GRAY, spacing=1.3)\\n    y += 0.99\\n\\n# right: ask box\\nbox_x = ML + 6.9\\nrect(s, box_x, 3.62, CW - 6.9, 3.0, fill=NAVY)\\ntext(s, box_x + 0.35, 3.85, CW - 7.6, 0.24, \\\"本次 QBR 唯一需要的决定\\\", size=10.5, bold=True, color=AMBER)\\ntext(s, box_x + 0.35, 4.18, CW - 7.6, 0.7, \\\"将免费试用期\\\\n回调至 14 天\\\", size=19, bold=True, color=WHITE, spacing=1.25)\\nhline(s, box_x + 0.35, 5.0, CW - 7.8, RGBColor(0x33, 0x47, 0x5C))\\ntext(s, box_x + 0.35, 5.18, CW - 7.7, 1.25,\\n     \\\"成本：无直接现金成本，仅影响付费转化节奏\\\\n代价：短期转化率口径会波动 1 个季度\\\\n时限：需在本周内拍板，否则 10 月样本已污染\\\",\\n     size=10, color=RGBColor(0xB9, 0xC4, 0xD1), spacing=1.45)\\n\\n# =========================================================\\n# 3. METRICS OVERVIEW\\n# =========================================================\\ns = slide_base(\\\"01 · 指标总览\\\", \\\"核心指标一览：五项指标，四个月同向恶化\\\",\\n               \\\"趋势比单点更重要——三个月里每一次读数都比上一次差\\\")\\nfooter(s, 3, \\\"注：Q3 收入为三个月合计；环比列取 9 月对 7 月。\\\")\\nrows = [\\n    [\\\"收入（USD）\\\", \\\"182,000\\\", \\\"176,000\\\", \\\"171,000\\\", \\\"−6.0%\\\", \